{"id":"wb-8-639","name":"河南省博物馆旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"河南省博物馆旧址","text":"河南博物馆旧址位于河南省开封市龙亭区北书店街道三胜街31号，是河南博物馆（现河南博物院）创建及在开封发展的所在。其所在地开封三圣庙街(今开封三胜街)31号原为河南法政学堂和河道总督衙门旧址。现存的前院过厅、后院展厅、办公用房等建筑作为近现代重要史迹及代表性建筑被列入第五批河南省文物保护单位名单。2019年10月16日，由中华人民共和国国务院公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E7%9C%81%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":91254918,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91254918","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ecf34ff3af1c1f9a51e40323.jpg","title":"GREG3838.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:GREG3838.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/24/GREG3838.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Greg kf (talk)","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"henan musem at kaifeng","width":320,"height":212}}